    "low_risk": [
      "Keep use_sparse_lbc=false for regular-relaxation campaigns; this avoids 19.2 s and 796 MB per hourly record.",
      "Compute each content digest once and pass it through writers, manifest creation, and validation; measured duplicate checksum work is about 10.5 s per sparse record, with a further roughly 7 s repeated by validation.",
      "Make sparse LBC opt-in in defaults as well as explicit in production configuration."
